or your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1: ","created_at":"2026-01-22T21:31:46+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-22T21:31:46+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":160899443,"discussion_id":"9086908959a403a754dfd3e5b04b2dfd463aa64a","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-01-22T21:31:48+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-22T21:31:48+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":160899626,"discussion_id":"5fb59b7f7cb120f8d498fedfc71ad665b40fc0a3","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复量化矩阵乘法（QuantMatmul）操作在微缩放（MicroScaling）模式下，当输入张量转置（transX1）为true且缩放张量（x1Scale）数据类型为e8m0时，K维度分组大小（scaleSizeK）的计算逻辑错误。该错误可能导致后续分组推断失败或计算结果不正确。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修正了`InferGroupSize`函数中微缩放模式下的`scaleSizeK`计算逻辑。核心修改是：当`transX1`为true时，`scaleSizeK`的维度索引从原逻辑的倒数第二维更正为第一维，并统一乘以2以适配e8m0数据类型下缩放张量的特殊形状格式（`[m, k/2, 2]`或`[k/2, m, 2]`）。同时，对非微缩放模式下的相关索引计算也进行了相应调整，确保逻辑一致性。","created_at":"2026-01-22T21:33:26+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-22T21:33:26+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":160905245,"discussion_id":"263ca46d0ea11